  "domComparison": "innerHTML of #root, read right after each screenshot. identicalDom compares it raw. identicalDomIgnoringChartIds first replaces the ids Recharts generates per mount (recharts<N>-clip, React useId _r_<x>_), which differ between any two runs of the same build; domSha256 is of that normalized DOM."
}
